    "body": "Local commit 02ceecef5 on `issue/2382-wcs-origin`. The gate is in progress.\n- New pinning tests in `crates/app/tests/wcs_start.rs`: a 2D face, a 3D parallel finish and a drill, with G54 away from the world origin.\n- The 2D and 3D tests fail on main: the approach starts at X0 Y0, not at G54 X40 Y20.\n- `seat_approach` unit tests are in `crates/cl/tests/origin_approach.rs`.\n- No golden changed: `golden_cl`, `first_router_part`, `axis_direction` and `wcs_rotation_control` pass.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
